# Host-only environment for webrtcsays-demo.service.
# Create /etc/webrtcsays-demo/directcall.env mode 0600 from the live
# process before stopping it. Do not commit the real file.
# The capture helper copies only runtime keys (LD_LIBRARY_PATH, PATH,
# WHILLATS_*, STYLETTS*, ESPEAK*, GGML_*, LANG, LC_*, HOME).
#
# LD_LIBRARY_PATH=
# WHILLATS_SERVER=
# STYLETTS2_MODEL_DIR=
# ESPEAK_DATA_PATH=
# GGML_BACKEND_DL_SEARCH_PATH=
